{
  "schema": "dialogue.v3",
  "debug_note": "Dialogue is referenced by narrative beats and elastic contracts. Elastic dialogue cannot advance major story flags unless its contract explicitly allows it.",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "dlg_opening_aen_vo",
      "speaker": "AEN",
      "text": "In the world born of lanternlight, every soul carries a spark. Mine was twofold… Yin and Yang… my guiding spirits.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_opening_lantern_heights",
      "tags": [
        "vo",
        "origin"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_tai_begin_path",
      "speaker": "INSTRUCTOR_TAI",
      "text": "Today you begin your true path, Aen. A ninja of the Lantern Clan must forge his own legacy.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_opening_lantern_heights",
      "tags": [
        "mentor"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_rilu_intro",
      "speaker": "MERCHANT_RILU",
      "text": "Fresh steel! Fresh cloth! You'll need both if you're taking on missions.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_meet_villagers",
      "tags": [
        "merchant"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_jenro_intro",
      "speaker": "SMITH_JENRO",
      "text": "Bring me what you find out there. I'll forge you the tools you deserve.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_meet_villagers",
      "tags": [
        "smith"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_samson_intro",
      "speaker": "SAMSON",
      "text": "Aen! You're finally ranked. Knew you had the spark.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_meet_villagers",
      "tags": [
        "friend",
        "samson"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_samson_maiden_warning",
      "speaker": "SAMSON",
      "text": "If you run missions with that Maiden, watch your back. Her smile is… sharp.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_meet_villagers",
      "tags": [
        "warning",
        "samson"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_samson_yin_yang_cats",
      "speaker": "SAMSON",
      "text": "Yin and Yang like you more than the lantern cats do. That's talent.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_meet_villagers",
      "tags": [
        "warmth"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_sophia_intro",
      "speaker": "SOPHIA",
      "text": "I've charted most of the Heights. But some paths only reveal themselves to those who walk with honest intention.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_meet_villagers",
      "tags": [
        "map",
        "wisdom"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_sophia_outsider_warning",
      "speaker": "SOPHIA",
      "text": "Be careful with outsiders, Aen. Not all who glow are warm.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_meet_villagers",
      "tags": [
        "warning"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_marcel_intro",
      "speaker": "MARCEL",
      "text": "If you scrape that blade again, I'll replace it myself. Come here.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_meet_villagers",
      "tags": [
        "smith",
        "friend"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_marcel_praise_warning",
      "speaker": "MARCEL",
      "text": "Anyone who praises you too quickly usually wants something.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_meet_villagers",
      "tags": [
        "warning"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_hazel_intro",
      "speaker": "HAZEL",
      "text": "Your spirits glow bright today. Are you excited… or nervous?",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_meet_villagers",
      "tags": [
        "gentle"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_hazel_star_thread",
      "speaker": "HAZEL",
      "text": "If you need new lantern silk, I've been experimenting with star-thread.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_meet_villagers",
      "tags": [
        "lantern_silk"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_veil_first_appearance",
      "speaker": "VEIL_MAIDEN",
      "text": "Aen… the prodigy of Lantern Heights. I have watched your training. You shine brighter than the rest.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_veil_maiden_request",
      "tags": [
        "praise",
        "predatory"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_veil_first_mission",
      "speaker": "VEIL_MAIDEN",
      "text": "Deep in these woods, a corrupted beast stirs. The others are too cautious. But you… you are different.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_mistwood_first_mission",
      "tags": [
        "mission",
        "praise"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_yang_maiden_warning",
      "speaker": "YANG",
      "text": "Aen, something feels strange with her…",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_mistwood_first_mission",
      "tags": [
        "spirit_warning"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_yin_maiden_warning",
      "speaker": "YIN",
      "text": "She clouds even our light.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_mistwood_first_mission",
      "tags": [
        "spirit_warning"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_aen_defends_maiden",
      "speaker": "AEN",
      "text": "She trusts me with important tasks. That must mean something.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_mistwood_first_mission",
      "tags": [
        "denial"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_rilu_distance",
      "speaker": "MERCHANT_RILU",
      "text": "Sorry Aen… I just… need some distance. Things feel off around here.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_npc_withdrawal",
      "tags": [
        "withdrawal"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_aen_distance_question",
      "speaker": "AEN",
      "text": "Distance? From what?",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_npc_withdrawal",
      "tags": [
        "confusion"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_samson_fading_presence",
      "speaker": "SAMSON",
      "text": "Hey… you look tired. You been doing only her missions again? Don't forget who you were before you met her, Aen.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_act0_isolation_dialogue",
      "tags": [
        "warning"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_sophia_rare_appearance",
      "speaker": "SOPHIA",
      "text": "The village feels off… like something is dimming the lanterns. If I'm not around next time, just know — I wish you well.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_act0_isolation_dialogue",
      "tags": [
        "warning",
        "departure"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_marcel_warning",
      "speaker": "MARCEL",
      "text": "Listen. Jenro closed his forge early. Everyone's uneasy. Be careful. …Don't let her talk you into abandoning the rest of us.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_act0_isolation_dialogue",
      "tags": [
        "warning"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_hazel_warning",
      "speaker": "HAZEL",
      "text": "Aen… the way she watches you… it chills my lantern flame. Don't disappear on us, okay?",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_act0_isolation_dialogue",
      "tags": [
        "warning",
        "gentle"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_aen_vo_isolation",
      "speaker": "AEN",
      "text": "Everyone was drifting away. And the more alone I became… the more she praised me.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_subtle_isolation_cutscene",
      "tags": [
        "vo",
        "isolation"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_veil_only_need_me",
      "speaker": "VEIL_MAIDEN",
      "text": "Look around. They never believed in you. But I do. Because you outshined them. You only need me now.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_subtle_isolation_cutscene",
      "tags": [
        "manipulation"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_samson_last_departure",
      "speaker": "SAMSON",
      "text": "You're my brother, Aen. But if you keep following her… I can't follow you.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_final_departures",
      "tags": [
        "departure"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_sophia_last_departure",
      "speaker": "SOPHIA",
      "text": "She whispers poison. And you're breathing it in.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_final_departures",
      "tags": [
        "departure"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_marcel_last_departure",
      "speaker": "MARCEL",
      "text": "She's shutting us out. All of us. You need to see what's happening!",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_final_departures",
      "tags": [
        "departure"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_hazel_last_departure",
      "speaker": "HAZEL",
      "text": "Aen… I wish you knew how much you mattered. Even without her.",
      "plateau": "LANTERN_HEIGHTS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_final_departures",
      "tags": [
        "departure",
        "gentle"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_veil_outshined_them",
      "speaker": "VEIL_MAIDEN",
      "text": "They never believed in you. You outshined them. You only need me now.",
      "plateau": "SUMMIT_SHRINE",
      "beat_ref": "beat_empty_hub_only_maiden",
      "tags": [
        "false_praise"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_siren_reveal_gave_everything",
      "speaker": "SIREN_OF_MASKS",
      "text": "You gave me everything. Your trust. Your focus. Your isolation. Now… give me the rest.",
      "plateau": "SUMMIT_SHRINE",
      "beat_ref": "beat_siren_reveal",
      "tags": [
        "reveal"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_aen_what_are_you",
      "speaker": "AEN",
      "text": "W-What are you?!",
      "plateau": "SUMMIT_SHRINE",
      "beat_ref": "beat_siren_reveal",
      "tags": [
        "fear"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_siren_cracks_lonely_heart",
      "speaker": "SIREN_OF_MASKS",
      "text": "I am what grows in the cracks of a lonely heart.",
      "plateau": "SUMMIT_SHRINE",
      "beat_ref": "beat_siren_reveal",
      "tags": [
        "antagonist"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_siren_spirits_balance",
      "speaker": "SIREN_OF_MASKS",
      "text": "Your spirits… your balance… your children of soul.",
      "plateau": "SUMMIT_SHRINE",
      "beat_ref": "beat_yin_yang_taken",
      "tags": [
        "theft"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_aen_no",
      "speaker": "AEN",
      "text": "NO!",
      "plateau": "SUMMIT_SHRINE",
      "beat_ref": "beat_yin_yang_taken",
      "tags": [
        "loss"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_siren_you_are_hollow",
      "speaker": "SIREN_OF_MASKS",
      "text": "You are hollow now.",
      "plateau": "SUMMIT_SHRINE",
      "beat_ref": "beat_yin_yang_taken",
      "tags": [
        "hollowing"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_hermit_awaken_hollow_one",
      "speaker": "SHADE_HERMIT",
      "text": "Awaken, Hollow One.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_hollowing_intro",
      "tags": [
        "awakening"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_aen_spirits_taken",
      "speaker": "AEN",
      "text": "My… spirits… they were taken…",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_hollowing_intro",
      "tags": [
        "loss"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_hermit_walk_dark",
      "speaker": "SHADE_HERMIT",
      "text": "Then you must walk the dark until you find yourself again.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_hollowing_intro",
      "tags": [
        "mentor"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_aen_body_heavy",
      "speaker": "AEN",
      "text": "My body… it feels heavy.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_hollow_depths_weight_dialogue",
      "tags": [
        "depression"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_hermit_depression_weight",
      "speaker": "SHADE_HERMIT",
      "text": "The caves feel heavier than they are. Keep walking anyway.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_hollow_depths_weight_dialogue",
      "tags": [
        "metaphor"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_echo_samson_alone",
      "speaker": "SAMSON_ECHO",
      "text": "You weren't alone… why did you walk away? I couldn't reach you.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_shadow_echo_fragments",
      "tags": [
        "echo",
        "samson"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_echo_sophia_help",
      "speaker": "SOPHIA_ECHO",
      "text": "I wanted to help… but she turned your eyes from me.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_shadow_echo_fragments",
      "tags": [
        "echo",
        "sophia"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_echo_marcel_broke",
      "speaker": "MARCEL_ECHO",
      "text": "You pushed so hard… until you broke.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_shadow_echo_fragments",
      "tags": [
        "echo",
        "marcel"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_echo_hazel_worth_saving",
      "speaker": "HAZEL_ECHO",
      "text": "You never stopped being worth saving.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_shadow_echo_fragments",
      "tags": [
        "echo",
        "hazel"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_hermit_weightbound_warning",
      "speaker": "SHADE_HERMIT",
      "text": "This one feeds on weariness. The longer the fight, the stronger it grows. You must be decisive.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_weightbound_ogre",
      "tags": [
        "boss_intro"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_smith_monk_still_fight",
      "speaker": "SMITH_MONK",
      "text": "You still fight. Good. Let me rebuild what was lost.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_dash_restored",
      "tags": [
        "unlock"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_hermit_shatter_moth_warning",
      "speaker": "SHADE_HERMIT",
      "text": "The floor here lies. Step where you'd expect nothing to hold.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_shatter_moth_queen",
      "tags": [
        "boss_intro"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_aen_fractured_contact_vo",
      "speaker": "AEN",
      "text": "I could feel their light… once. But every time I reached… the world broke beneath me.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_fractured_contact_double_jump",
      "tags": [
        "vo",
        "unlock"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_stone_judge_seek_justice",
      "speaker": "STONE_JUDGE",
      "text": "You seek justice? You shall earn nothing.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_stone_judge",
      "tags": [
        "boss_intro"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_aen_seek_spirits",
      "speaker": "AEN",
      "text": "I seek only my spirits back.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_stone_judge",
      "tags": [
        "resolve"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_stone_judge_suffer",
      "speaker": "STONE_JUDGE",
      "text": "Then you shall suffer.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_stone_judge",
      "tags": [
        "boss_intro"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_aen_yin_yang_please",
      "speaker": "AEN",
      "text": "Yin! Yang! Please—!",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_final_cutoff_glide",
      "tags": [
        "loss"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_hermit_path_closes",
      "speaker": "SHADE_HERMIT",
      "text": "The way back is sealed. There is a descent to the west.",
      "plateau": "HOLLOW_DEPTHS",
      "beat_ref": "beat_final_cutoff_glide",
      "tags": [
        "unlock"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_kai_not_alone",
      "speaker": "BROTHER_KAI",
      "text": "You are not alone, Hollow One.",
      "plateau": "EMBER_MONASTERY",
      "beat_ref": "beat_hearth_of_brothers",
      "tags": [
        "support"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_len_walk_together",
      "speaker": "BROTHER_LEN",
      "text": "We walk together now.",
      "plateau": "EMBER_MONASTERY",
      "beat_ref": "beat_hearth_of_brothers",
      "tags": [
        "support"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_aen_why_help",
      "speaker": "AEN",
      "text": "Why help me?",
      "plateau": "EMBER_MONASTERY",
      "beat_ref": "beat_hearth_of_brothers",
      "tags": [
        "vulnerability"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_kai_someone_helped_us",
      "speaker": "BROTHER_KAI",
      "text": "Because someone once helped us. Sit. Speak. Heal.",
      "plateau": "EMBER_MONASTERY",
      "beat_ref": "beat_hearth_of_brothers",
      "tags": [
        "support"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_roga_strength_pain",
      "speaker": "MENTOR_ROGA",
      "text": "Strength is not the absence of pain. It is mastery over it.",
      "plateau": "EMBER_MONASTERY",
      "beat_ref": "beat_roga_training_wallcling",
      "tags": [
        "mentor"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_samson_returns",
      "speaker": "SAMSON",
      "text": "You fell far, brother. But I'm here now. And I'm not leaving again.",
      "plateau": "EMBER_MONASTERY",
      "beat_ref": "beat_samson_returns",
      "tags": [
        "return"
      ],
      "line_role": "authored",
      "conditions": []
    },
